{{!-- Where the party is and when. The day and the route share the top line — the day is what the
      Warden says out loud and the route is the standing description of it, so one is the heading
      and the other is its caption rather than two bands.

      Under them the journey in watches, one tick per watch with the travelled ones inked. The
      weather's "add one watch to the journey" and the Warden's NEEDED counter both grow it,
      because both make the route longer.

      Then the line that counts them. The Warden's hand on the two numbers sits on that same line:
      the counters carry no figure of their own, because the bar above them and the sentence
      beside them already say 1 of 10, and a third copy would only be a third thing to keep in
      step. What each pair moves is its tooltip.

      The three watches of the day belong to the sky over them, so they are in the watch part's
      Weather heading, not here. --}}
<section class="cairn-journey-head">
{{#if journey}}
    <div class="cairn-journey-top">
        <span class="cairn-journey-day">{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.Day" day=journey.day}}</span>
        <p class="cairn-journey-route">
            {{route.path}} &middot; {{route.distance}} &middot; {{route.terrain}}{{#if route.terrainRaised}} <span class="cairn-journey-raised">{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.Raised"}}</span>{{/if}} &middot; {{route.season}}
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cairn-journey-progress">
        <ol class="cairn-journey-ticks" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0"
            aria-valuemax="{{journey.watchesNeeded}}" aria-valuenow="{{journey.progress}}">
            {{#each ticks}}<li class="{{#if done}}done{{/if}}"></li>{{/each}}
        </ol>
        <div class="cairn-journey-count">
            <p class="cairn-journey-progress-label">
                {{#if journey.arrived}}{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.Arrived"}}{{else}}{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.Progress" progress=journey.progress needed=journey.watchesNeeded}}{{/if}}
                {{#if journey.lost}}<span class="cairn-journey-flag">{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.LostFlag"}}</span>{{/if}}
                {{#if journey.sleepDeprived}}<span class="cairn-journey-flag">{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.SleepDeprived"}}</span>{{/if}}
            </p>
            {{#if isGM}}
            <div class="cairn-journey-adjust">
                <span class="cairn-journey-adjust-label">{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.Needed"}}</span>
                <button type="button" data-action="adjust" data-field="watchesNeeded" data-delta="-1"
                        data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.FewerNeeded'}}" aria-label="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.FewerNeeded'}}">&minus;</button>
                <button type="button" data-action="adjust" data-field="watchesNeeded" data-delta="1"
                        data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.MoreNeeded'}}" aria-label="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.MoreNeeded'}}">+</button>
                <span class="cairn-journey-adjust-label">{{localize "CAIRN.Journey.TravelledLabel"}}</span>
                <button type="button" data-action="adjust" data-field="progress" data-delta="-1"
                        data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.FewerTravelled'}}" aria-label="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.FewerTravelled'}}">&minus;</button>
                <button type="button" data-action="adjust" data-field="progress" data-delta="1"
                        data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.MoreTravelled'}}" aria-label="{{localize 'CAIRN.Journey.MoreTravelled'}}">+</button>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>
    </div>

{{/if}}
</section>
